OL,3,GNEWSAApplications open for British
OL,4,ASteel roles
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish Steel is encouraging local
OL,7,Fpeople to apply for next year's
OL,8,Fapprenticeship and graduate schemes,
OL,9,Fcalling them "positions for the
OL,10,Ffuture".
OL,12,FMore than 40 new workers will be
OL,13,Femployed across sites in Scunthorpe,
OL,14,FTeesside and Skinningrove, starting in
OL,15,FSeptember 2027.
OL,17,FThey will join 70 apprentices and 16
OL,18,Fgraduates who started this September.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
