OL,3,GNEWSAApplications open for British
OL,4,ASteel roles
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's no secret that British Steel will
OL,7,Fbe going on a journey to decarbonise
OL,8,Fover the years, but we will still
OL,9,Fremain a significant employer... We
OL,10,Fneed a continued pipeline of employees
OL,11,Ffor the future needs of the business,"
OL,12,Fsaid HR director Nick Ashton.
